# Extensionless URLs are load-bearing here: every <link rel="canonical">, every
# internal href and every sitemap entry uses /freezer-alarm rather than
# /freezer-alarm.html. That works today only because Cloudflare Pages resolves
# it by default. Making it explicit means a hosting change (or a Pages default
# change) cannot silently 404 all nine canonicals at once.
/pilot            /pilot.html            200
/walk-in-cooler   /walk-in-cooler.html   200
/freezer-alarm    /freezer-alarm.html    200
/field-test       /field-test.html       200
/roi-calculator   /roi-calculator.html   200
/services         /services.html         200
/replacement-parts /replacement-parts.html 200
/about            /about.html            200
